  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =[\\begin{aligned}6p & -4q \\\\ -5p & 2q\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}p \\\\ q\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}6p\\cdot p & + & (-4q)\\cdot q \\\\ -5p\\cdot p & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2q\\cdot q\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6{p}^{2}-4{q}^{2} \\\\ -5{p}^{2}+2{q}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
